The numbers is a list of 2, 3, -2, and 4.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The high is item 0 of numbers.
The low is item 0 of numbers.
The best is item 0 of numbers.
For every spot from 1 to last.
The value is item spot of numbers.
The first is high times value.
The second is low times value.
The top is first.
If second is more than top, set top to second.
If value is more than top, set top to value.
The bottom is first.
If second is less than bottom, set bottom to second.
If value is less than bottom, set bottom to value.
Set high to top.
Set low to bottom.
If high is more than best, set best to high.

Show best.
